#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""wane — exclusive-A path-conditions (what died), occupied through history.

thatch covers a two-tree delta with a mixed budget: exclusive-A
reservation, exclusive-B births, leftover AB moves/`else` spreads.
sheaf covers with grep/exists. tenure occupies one user-pinned FILE:LINE.

wane's object is only the stacks that died: true on A, false on B.
No exclusive-B flood. No generic AB `else`. Invert the trees to ask
what was born. Occupancy still detaches identity from the walk end.
"""

